#: templates/matches/rules.html:6
msgid ""
"Exact score, good gap, correct winner — how points are calculated in "
"Oval'Pronos."
msgstr ""
"Score exact, bon écart, bon vainqueur — comment les points sont calculés "
"dans Oval'Pronos."

